# Third-Party Licenses

KSquad is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see `LICENSE`).
It depends on the third-party components listed below. Their license terms
apply to those components only; each remains the property of its authors.

This file records the **direct** module dependencies declared in `go.mod`.
The authoritative, complete (direct + transitive) inventory for any given
release is the SBOM (SPDX/CycloneDX) produced by the `build-images` pipeline
via Syft and signed with cosign. Regenerate a local snapshot with:

    go list -m -json all        # Go module graph
    syft dir:.                  # full SBOM including transitive deps

